0..77 Comment "//! A specification monad as a theory: a monad whose computations are ordered"
78..135 Comment "//! and whose extension is monotone in both its arguments"
136..214 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all], § 3.3. An operation lands in a sort,"
215..289 Comment "//! not in `Type`, so the order is a sort indexed by two computations, and"
290..368 Comment "//! evidence of it is a term its operations build. The monad\'s laws beside the"
369..410 Comment "//! indexed sort are refused in the twin."
411..414 Comment "//!"
415..431 Comment "//! - see: #4128"
432..480 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
481..484 Comment "//!"
485..600 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
602..674 Comment "/// Values `V`, computations `C` and the order between two computations:"
675..742 Comment "/// reflexive, transitive, and an extension below another where its"
743..793 Comment "/// computation and each of its continuations are."
